LRC support-flow and cut-flow probe -- codex-2026-06-01 S540
==============================================================================
Flow side: |SAFE| is a support-decomposed NZ-flow enumerator over sub-dipoles.
Cut side: danger arcs induce a nonnegative cover flow on the time-cell cycle.

